BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (The six reference modules below concatenate into one Python 3.9 script using SQLite and the standard library. They) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (are an accounting and workflow kernel, not a replacement for device-specific service procedures or a payment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (provider. Run one connection per worker against a local disk database, enable foreign keys on every connection, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (keep the database off shared network filesystems. BEGIN IMMEDIATE serializes competing writers before either can) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (read mutable state. Every operation records a canonical payload under a stable event key; an identical retry returns) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (without side effects, while changed content under the same key fails. Device transitions also compare an expected) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (version, so two operators cannot both advance the same version. A busy timeout produces a retryable failure rather than) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (a partial transaction. Store integer cents and explicit account names, never floating currency. The journal accepts only) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (balanced batches and makes posted rows immutable. This reference intentionally excludes payables, deposits, taxes,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (and foreign currencies; extend its account model and reconciliation equation before introducing those transactions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (Restrict writes to these functions because arbitrary SQL access bypasses application-level authorization and batch) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (validation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (Verification is an evidence decision, not a Boolean supplied by a marketplace webhook. The authenticated application) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (must check reviewer identity, document hashes, signer authority, and provider receipts before calling advance. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (compact kernel requires nonempty evidence references and preserves them inside the event payload; it does not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (validate a laboratory certificate or authenticate an escrow message itself. Its state path moves from intake through) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (verified, funded, released, accepted, and settled. Funded means the agreed escrow provider has confirmed the required) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (funds, not that operator cash or revenue has been recognized. Released requires a packing record and shipment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (authority; accepted requires the contractual acceptance record. Post revenue when the governing sale terms establish) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (the recognition event, using an accountant-reviewed policy rather than the state label alone. Settled requires a matched) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (bank reference and the relevant receipt journal. Keep returns and disputes in a separate controlled exception process) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (with reversing entries; never overwrite the original sale. The deliberately linear reference rejects unsupported) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (transitions instead of pretending that every equipment dispute can be resolved through one universal automated state) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (diagram.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (Posting creates its notification in the same database transaction as the journal, eliminating the lost-message interval) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (between committing money and queuing work. Dispatch is at least once: a crash after remote receipt but before the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.15 Tm (local acknowledgement causes a retry with the identical key and payload. The receiver must atomically deduplicate that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.92 Tm (key and reject payload changes; without that contract, duplicate external effects remain possible. Notifications contain) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 289.70 Tm (no payment or shipment command, and consumers must not derive ordered physical actions from their delivery order.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 274.47 Tm (This confines race-free mutation to the documented transaction boundary rather than making an impossible promise) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 259.25 Tm (about arbitrary external systems. Use the provider's immutable transaction identifier as the posting reference and reject) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 244.02 Tm (identifiers invented for retries. Reconcile the trial balance, inventory account, receivables, and bank statement daily.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 228.80 Tm (The reference identity assumes zero opening balances and separately posted capital, which suits the worked cohort.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 213.57 Tm (Production operation also requires encrypted backups, restricted evidence access, tested restores, and independent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 198.35 Tm (review of source totals. A balanced journal proves arithmetic consistency; it does not prove that the equipment exists or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 183.12 Tm (that a customer actually accepted it.) Tj ET
