BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (the ordinary commercial research store, where broader contractor access would create unnecessary exposure.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (Run the enrichment waterfall in order of cost and decision value. First, normalize seller identity and device labels using) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (deterministic rules, preserving every original value. Second, query public product and recall records, joining by exact) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (identifiers before attempting model aliases. Third, establish seller authority, lien questions, and possession through) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (contracts, debtor searches, and direct confirmation. UCC searches must follow the debtor's legal identity and applicable) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.80 Tm (filing jurisdiction; a convenient local search alone can miss relevant filings. Fourth, request service history,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (manufacturer support status, option-transfer conditions, and an accessory manifest. Fifth, obtain buyer-specific demand) Tj ET
