BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.12 Tm (propose a candidate record but must not clear a recall, transfer a software license, or release a device. Use an explicit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 160.90 Tm (unresolved flag that blocks the affected decision while allowing unrelated research to continue. Each step should have) Tj ET
