BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 130.45 Tm (from rejecting an unsupported platform before freight is booked than from adding another hundred vaguely similar) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 115.22 Tm (listings to its database. Reserve expensive contractor time for assets that survive these inexpensive checks.) Tj ET
